### 测试1：创建订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2,
  "address": "宿舍楼A栋301室",
  "phone": "13812345678",
  "note": "不要放辣",
  "items": [
    {
      "dishId": 4,
      "quantity": 2
    },
    {
      "dishId": 5,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 测试2：获取订单详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1

### 测试3：获取用户所有订单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/user/2

### 测试4：更新订单状态为准备中
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/status?status=PREPARING

### 测试5：获取订单统计
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/user/2/stats

### 测试6：取消订单
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "用户取消订单"
}

### 测试7：查询订单（按订单号）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/number/ORD1765066963821842